  "description": "At home at the park or in the street, the Mongoose Stance Elite Freestyle Scooter is the perfect way to rip around town. This pro-style park-performance scooter looks rad and really excels at the skate park or stomping through the urban jungle. Stand out from the pack on the Mongoose Stance Elite Freestyle Scooter.\nLightweight alloy deck with extended standing area and front and rear alloy pegs for pro-style park performance.\nAlloy deck and alloy brake combine with 100 mm high impact alloy wheels and durable ABEC-9 bearings.\nOne-piece welded steel Y-bar handlebar with premium anodized clamp bike-style grips.\nQuadruple anodized clamp collar for precise, crisp steering wherever you go.\nHeavy-duty frame supports children 8+ up to 220 lbs.",
